aphy that characterized 'Blade Runner 2049'."},{"source":"work_aw366","target":"work_aw369","type":"work_work","relation_type":"influenced","relation_note":"The film's highly detailed, atmospheric, and technologically advanced dystopian cityscape, combined with its profound thematic depth, significantly contributed to and refined the visual and narrative benchmarks for the contemporary cyberpunk genre, influencing later works like the 'Cyberpunk 2077' game."},{"source":"work_aw366","target":"work_aw27","type":"work_work","relation_type":"inspired_by","relation_note":"Blade Runner 2049 directly continues and expands upon the narrative, visual aesthetic, and profound philosophical questions first established in its iconic 1982 predecessor."},{"source":"work_aw366","target":"work_aw367","type":"work_work","relation_type":"inspired_by","relation_note":"As a sequel to the film adaptation, 'Blade Runner 2049' inherits and further explores the core existential themes of artificial intelligence, memory, and the definition of humanity originated in Dick's seminal novel."},{"source":"work_aw366","target":"work_aw126","type":"work_work","relation_type":"inspired_by","relation_note":"The film's grand scale, deliberate pacing, monumental visual compositions, and deep philosophical inquiries into human and artificial existence draw significant inspiration from Kubrick's landmark science fiction epic."},{"source":"work_aw366","target":"work_aw368","type":"work_work","relation_type":"inspired_by","relation_note":"Blade Runner 2049 continues a cinematic tradition, pioneered by 'Metropolis,' of depicting vast, stratified dystopian cities and exploring the ethical dilemmas surrounding the creation of artificial beings and societal class divides."},{"source":"person_ap7","target":"person_ap117","type":"person_person","relation_type":"influenced_by","relation_note":"Derived: Akira → Blade Runner","confidence":"corroborated"},{"source":"person_ap83","target":"person_ap117","type":"person